00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.491
Unit eight. Periods and Menstrual Health!

2
00:00:04.444 --> 00:00:08.344
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.394 --> 00:00:11.662
