4
00:00:11.712 --> 00:00:16.033
Today we learn about Periods and Menstrual Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.732 --> 00:00:21.065
Menstruation. Say it with me. Menstruation!

6
00:00:24.561 --> 00:00:27.994
Period. Say it with me. Period!

7
00:00:31.494 --> 00:00:34.644
Pad. Say it with me. Pad!

8
00:00:38.154 --> 00:00:41.771
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

9
00:00:45.251 --> 00:00:48.768
Cramps. Say it with me. Cramps!

10
00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:55.732
Normal. Say it with me. Normal!

11
00:00:59.215 --> 00:01:02.632
Change. Say it with me. Change!

12
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.257
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

13
00:01:12.742 --> 00:01:25.932
Menstruation, or a period, is a normal part of puberty for girls. Using a clean pad and changing it regularly keeps good hygiene. Mild cramps are common, but a doctor can help with strong pain.

14
00:01:25.982 --> 00:01:27.394
I can do that too!

15
00:01:28.674 --> 00:01:34.031
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.081 --> 00:01:35.167
Pad!

17
00:01:35.839 --> 00:01:40.980
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:42.180
Change!

19
00:01:43.158 --> 00:01:48.801
Did you know? Periods are a normal sign that the body is growing up healthy!

20
00:01:48.851 --> 00:01:50.977
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.681 --> 00:01:59.945
Think and answer. How can classmates be respectful about periods?

22
00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:01.145
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.449 --> 00:02:07.439
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
